Adapted source from fcitx5-vinput (https://github.com/xifan2333/fcitx5-vinput)
and its Mobius fork, source snapshot d571be21:
- src/vad_trimmer.cpp and src/vad_trimmer.h: VAD detection and trimming,
  from apps/voice-input/src/daemon/asr/vad_trimmer.*.
- src/text_join.h: recognized-text joining,
  from apps/voice-input/src/daemon/asr/text_join.h.
- Quiet-boundary long-audio splitting in src/asr.cpp,
  from apps/voice-input/src/daemon/asr/backends/refining_backend.cpp.

These portions were adapted or reformatted for Hyprvoice on 2026-10-03.
Their original GPL-3.0 license is preserved. Other application modules were
implemented for this independent application. No runtime or build dependency
on fcitx5-vinput is required.

nlohmann/json has its separate MIT license under third_party/nlohmann/.
Model weights have separate licenses and are not included in the source tree.
